     LARGE: this is the one control someone taps repeatedly, and on a phone a
     44px target is the floor. They also stay clear of the picture's middle so
     a click there still closes the layer. */
  .full-nav {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 3.25rem;
    height: 4.5rem;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
